<title>USA: Kinder Morgan names Thomas King president.</title>
<headline>Kinder Morgan names Thomas King president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kinder Morgan Energy Partners LP said Monday said it named Thomas B. King as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>King was previously vice president for Midwest commerical operations of Enron Corp's liquid services unit and had in several managerial positions with Enron since December 1989. King is a native of Houston and a graduate of Louisiana State University.</p>
</text>
